{"id":"9b4f789d5b116c80","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-well-founded-frame.md","title":"Well-founded Frame","display":"df-well-founded-frame — Well-founded Frame","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-well-founded-frame","aliases":["89-df-well-founded-frame"],"display":"df-well-founded-frame — Well-founded Frame","depends_on":["[[89-df-well-founded]]","[[89-df-kripke-frame]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-well-founded-frame"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-well-founded-frame</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-well-founded-frame — Well-founded Frame"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9eaa23de86feec90\" href=\"?note=9eaa23de86feec90\" title=\"89-df-well-founded\">89-df-well-founded</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c78d4bf1505bda5c\" href=\"?note=c78d4bf1505bda5c\" title=\"89-df-kripke-frame\">89-df-kripke-frame</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-well-founded-frame-—-Well-founded-Frame-$\\mathcal{F}_{\\mathrm{wf}}$\">df-well-founded-frame — Well-founded Frame <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{F}_{\\mathrm{wf}}\">\\(\\mathcal{F}_{\\mathrm{wf}}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{F}=(W,R)\">\\(\\mathcal{F}=(W,R)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c78d4bf1505bda5c\" href=\"?note=c78d4bf1505bda5c\" title=\"89-df-kripke-frame\">89-df-kripke-frame</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WF}_{W}\">\\(\\mathrm{WF}_{W}\\)</span> is the predicate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9eaa23de86feec90\" href=\"?note=9eaa23de86feec90\" title=\"89-df-well-founded\">89-df-well-founded</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}well\\text{-}founded\\text{-}frame}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{WFFrm}(\\mathcal{F})\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{WF}_{W}(R).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}well\\text{-}founded\\text{-}frame}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{WFFrm}(\\mathcal{F})\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{WF}_{W}(R).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> : 可达关系 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9eaa23de86feec90\" href=\"?note=9eaa23de86feec90\" title=\"89-df-well-founded\">89-df-well-founded</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{F}\">\\(\\mathcal{F}\\)</span> : Kripke框架 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c78d4bf1505bda5c\" href=\"?note=c78d4bf1505bda5c\" title=\"89-df-kripke-frame\">89-df-kripke-frame</a>)</li>\n<li>良基框架：无无穷下降链</li>\n<li>GL 的通常 Kripke 条件使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 的逆良基性\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CWF}_{W}(R)\">\\(\\mathrm{CWF}_{W}(R)\\)</span>，而不是本文件的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WF}_{W}(R)\">\\(\\mathrm{WF}_{W}(R)\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-well-founded-frame-—-Well-founded-Frame-$\\mathcal{F}_{\\mathrm{wf}}$","text":"df-well-founded-frame — Well-founded Frame $\\mathcal{F}_{\\mathrm{wf}}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-well-founded","status":"resolved","id":"9eaa23de86feec90","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-